{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"material-deep-ocean","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Material Deep Ocean","description":"A deep, saturated blue-black theme.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Material Deep Ocean","path":"themes/material-deep-ocean.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/material-deep-ocean.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Material Deep Ocean\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#0f111a\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#a6accd\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#1a1c25\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#1f2233\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#1a1c25\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#84ffff\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#84ffff\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#84ffff\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#1f2233\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#1a1c2580\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#84ffff\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#090b10\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#ff5370\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#c3e88d\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#ffcb6b\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f07178\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#464b5d\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c3e88d\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f78c6c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#c792ea\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffcb6b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#82aaff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f78c6c\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f07178\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f07178\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ffcb6b\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#89ddff\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Material Deep Ocean\n\nA deep, saturated blue-black theme.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Material Deep Ocean** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Material Theme palettes.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#0f111a` |\n| Text | `#a6accd` |\n| Accent | `#84ffff` |\n| Keywords | `#c792ea` |\n| Strings | `#c3e88d` |\n| Functions | `#82aaff` |\n| Types | `#ffcb6b` |\n| Comments | `#464b5d` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}